'or.p1':'CLUBCAFECOL was born in Huila, between Pitalito and Acevedo, and today we also grow in Barbosa (Santander), Sevilla (Valle del Cauca), the Cauca massif and the highlands of Nariño. We are coffee growers: the same people who prune, pick and control the fermentation are the ones who set the roast curve and seal the bag that reaches your home.',
